    <h1>AICOM (AIMarket)</h1>
<p class="pp-sub">Hlido Transparency Passport</p>
  <p class="pp-sub">
    <a href="https://alexar76.github.io/aicom/" rel="noopener nofollow" target="_blank">https://alexar76.github.io/aicom/</a> &middot; Infrastructure<br>
    Issued 2026-10-30 &middot; from an independent review dated 2026-08-05 &middot; next review due 2026-11-05<br>
    <span class="pp-free">Free</span> <span style="font-size:13px;opacity:.72">&mdash; no charge to the vendor, and no charge to read it.</span>
  </p>

  <div class="pp-layers">
    <div class="pp-layer">
      <p class="pp-sub">Independent review</p>
      <p class="pp-big">60<span>/100</span></p>
      <span class="pp-tag">FADING</span>
      <p class="pp-meta">Hands-on testing of the public surface. Scoring weights are private; the evidence is not.<br><a href="https://hlido.eu/reviews/alexar76-aimarket-plugins/">Full record &rarr;</a></p>
    </div>
    <div class="pp-layer">
      <p class="pp-sub">EU AI Act &mdash; Article 50</p>
      <p class="pp-big">84<span>/100</span></p>
      <span class="pp-tag pp-ok">READY</span>
      <p class="pp-meta">Transparency-duty readiness &mdash; meets the transparency signals we test for (confidence: low).<br><a href="/eu-ai-act/register/">Register &rarr;</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="pp-note"><strong>These two numbers are never combined.</strong> One says whether the product is good; the other says whether it meets a disclosure duty. A blended score would let a strong product hide a compliance gap, and a compliant one look better than it is.</p>

  <h2>What was verified</h2>
  <p class="pp-sub" style="margin:-4px 0 12px">5 of 5 checks passed, each dated and evidenced.</p>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Check</th><th>Result</th><th>Evidence</th><th>Tested</th></tr>
    <tr><td><code>homepage_loads</code></td><td class="pp-ok"><strong>PASS</strong></td><td>—</td><td style="opacity:.7;white-space:nowrap">2026-08-04</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>primary_value_prop</code></td><td class="pp-ok"><strong>PASS</strong></td><td>&#39;An open economy for autonomous AI agents.&#39;</td><td style="opacity:.7;white-space:nowrap">2026-08-04</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>cta_present</code></td><td class="pp-ok"><strong>PASS</strong></td><td>&#39;STAR ON GITHUB&#39; / &#39;TRY THE LIVE DEMO&#39;</td><td style="opacity:.7;white-space:nowrap">2026-08-04</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>pricing_or_access</code> <span style="opacity:.6;font-size:12px">optional</span></td><td class="pp-ok"><strong>PASS</strong></td><td>Self-hosted and open source; per-call pricing set by oracle operators</td><td style="opacity:.7;white-space:nowrap">2026-08-04</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>evidence_or_demo</code> <span style="opacity:.6;font-size:12px">optional</span></td><td class="pp-ok"><strong>PASS</strong></td><td>Live demo, whitepaper and knowledge base; self-authored tests only, no third-party audit</td><td style="opacity:.7;white-space:nowrap">2026-08-04</td></tr>
  </table>

  <h2>Article-50 signals observed</h2>
  <table>
    <tr><td>Marking / labelling statement</td><td class="pp-bad"><strong>not found</strong></td></tr>
    <tr><td>Detection tool declared</td><td class="pp-bad"><strong>not found</strong></td></tr>
    <tr><td>Code of Practice signatory</td><td>not determined</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Checked</td><td style="opacity:.7">2026-08-05</td></tr>
  </table>
  <p class="pp-meta" style="margin-top:12px">Basis: public homepage reachable &middot; clear stated purpose &middot; clear access path &middot; 3/3 required checks passed &middot; 1 red flag(s) &middot; transparent pricing/access &middot; demonstrable, not black-box &middot; login-walled — low confidence (partial view) &middot; MCP surface &middot; API surface</p>
  <p class="pp-meta">Deploying this agent yourself? Article 50 puts duties on <em>you</em> as its deployer, not only on the vendor &mdash; build a file for your whole stack with the free <a href="/eu-ai-act/evidence-file/">EU AI Act Evidence File</a>.</p>

  <h2>Evidence from the run</h2>
  <p class="pp-sub" style="margin:-4px 0 8px">4 screenshots captured by the Hlido engine (<code>run-6fe882dcfe238c1f-alexar76-github-io</code>). Our own captures &mdash; not vendor marketing material.</p>
  <div class="pp-shots"><a href="https://images.hlido.eu/reviews/alexar76-aimarket-plugins/run-6fe882dcfe238c1f-alexar76-github-io/home.png" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img src="https://images.hlido.eu/reviews/alexar76-aimarket-plugins/run-6fe882dcfe238c1f-alexar76-github-io/home.png" alt="AICOM (AIMarket) run screenshot" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="150"></a><a href="https://images.hlido.eu/reviews/alexar76-aimarket-plugins/run-6fe882dcfe238c1f-alexar76-github-io/page_flow.png" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img src="https://images.hlido.eu/reviews/alexar76-aimarket-plugins/run-6fe882dcfe238c1f-alexar76-github-io/page_flow.png" alt="AICOM (AIMarket) run screenshot" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="150"></a><a href="https://images.hlido.eu/reviews/alexar76-aimarket-plugins/run-6fe882dcfe238c1f-alexar76-github-io/page_oracles.png" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img src="https://images.hlido.eu/reviews/alexar76-aimarket-plugins/run-6fe882dcfe238c1f-alexar76-github-io/page_oracles.png" alt="AICOM (AIMarket) run screenshot" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="150"></a><a href="https://images.hlido.eu/reviews/alexar76-aimarket-plugins/run-6fe882dcfe238c1f-alexar76-github-io/page_mcp.png" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img src="https://images.hlido.eu/reviews/alexar76-aimarket-plugins/run-6fe882dcfe238c1f-alexar76-github-io/page_mcp.png" alt="AICOM (AIMarket) run screenshot" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="150"></a></div>

  <h2>Machine-readable</h2>
  <p class="pp-sub" style="margin:-4px 0 10px">Your customer&rsquo;s procurement agent can verify this without reading the page.</p>
  <pre>GET https://hlido.eu/data/passports/alexar76-aimarket-plugins.json
GET https://hlido.eu/data/scorecards/alexar76-aimarket-plugins.json

POST https://hlido.eu/mcp
{"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"get_scorecard","arguments":{"slug":"alexar76-aimarket-plugins"}}}</pre>

  <h2>Independence &amp; limits</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Free, and not paid for.</strong> Hlido takes no money from the products it rates. This passport was produced from an independent review the subject did not commission, pay for, or approve. It is free to publish and free to read &mdash; charging the subject is exactly what would make it worthless to the procurement desk it is handed to.</li>
    <li><strong>Not a certification.</strong> Hlido is not a notified body. This is not a conformity assessment, a certification, or legal advice. It is a dated record of what an independent party measured on the product&#39;s public surface.</li>
    <li><strong>Correctable.</strong> If anything here is wrong, <a href="/contact/">tell us</a> and we correct the record &mdash; the correction is dated too.</li>
  </ul>

